From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 08:46:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add enginev2: versioned PathCE-first 40-year portfolio engine
 with reproduce.py

Frozen, reproducible snapshot of the EngineV2 campaign (investing Project,
Addenda 1-6, 2026-08-29 .. 2026-09-03):

- lib_pathce.py: engine-exact Monte Carlo (60k paths, seed 42, yearly Markov
  redraw 1/8, lognormal sigma = vol48, fixed 3% draw, T=40), FastEval CRN
  evaluator, robust/canonical scenario weights, RCEW40 / DRB40 / R3AF,
  monthly-returns panel loader (canonical panel, etf-eod prices/, or
  etf-eod monthly_returns.csv), vol48/Sortino diagnostics, expense ratios
- core.py: 102-ticker universe, class lists, the constraint set, P1 floors
- flexdraw.py: the flexible-draw guardrail (3% -> 2.25% below 0.80x, restore 1.0x)
- books.json: P1, P2, R2_final, R2d, R1b_final, R1c, R3b, R3d, R3dK, SP500, 60/40
- data/decks: R6, R7cand, R8cand decks (24 scenarios), scenario weights,
  row grades, ER_R8.json; data/panel: canonical monthly panel 2014-01..2026-08
- reference/: R8 book metrics (with flexible-draw columns), R7 metrics, R8
  marginal tests, ballast ladder, row audit, flex-draw experiments
- reproduce.py: regenerates the metrics from the deck + panel; --check
  verifies reference/R8_Books_Metrics_20260903.csv to the digit (~1 min)

